        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVObBWjt9ngXMxzyhZAcemXEbUCPAnLWzuaYqbAMWDt74AaENgb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I went here for the first time almost a month ago. I got the guy who showed up about 10 minutes late to my appointment. He used a CAP on me!!!! The entire time I was in pain. He over processed my hair and completely ruined it. He was even hurting me while washing my hair. On top of everything he bleached my favourite summer shirt. I felt as if I was a nuisance to him. In my opinion he took the easy and fastest route. My hair was not what I asked for. My highlights did not reach my roots of my hair. And it looked funny. I do not recommend him!",
        "time": 1599949732,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hee Jung Choi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108626532750759743549/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgkZmirtMJI0JImDZKFpLjTYGZAQFx6OFz3-7oHL1_17PRXlXK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I went in and showed the hairdresser pictures of natural curl that I wanted. She turned my hair into tight noodles and completely ruined my hair. I’m still struggling with my hair now 4 months later. I will never return to this place and I do not recommend her to anyone.",
